<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NSA SAYS HOLDS 14 PERCENT OF OTK.</title>
<headline>NSA SAYS HOLDS 14 PERCENT OF OTK.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>NSA Investments Ltd said on Thursday it held 14 percent of newly-listed OTK Holdings Ltd, making it the largest single shareholder.</p>
<p>NSA chief executive Leonard Fine has been appointed to the OTK board.</p>
<p>The South African grain processing and storage firm -- formerly a co-operative -- made its stock market debut on November 11.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
